des","target_id":"a5d7-3662-d3c9-4334"},{"link_uuid":"f2a4da11-417d-4f36-821c-3c30c634bdaf","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"5946-6a4c-7026-42ac"},{"link_uuid":"15ee2bdd-e79d-4e61-a7bb-8a5982449218","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"f3a2-2b23-cb81-4e62"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe src/rebar/reducer cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/reducer/_cache.py:34-50` — Preserve the cache-version bump rule. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/reducer/_managed_refs.py:1-39` — Preserve monotonic managed-reference provenance and remove-versus-adopt semantics. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/reducer/_processors_status.py:26-84, 87-103, 109-126, 135-150, 178-208` — Preserve claim provenance, close metadata, fork tie-breaks, and status-edge conditions. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/reducer/_processors.py:160-177, 229-246, 321-334, 429-441, 584-596, 600-605, 613-620, 629-639` — Preserve legacy inference, unresolved-link handling, archive revert behavior, workflow LWW rules, and snapshot migrations. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/reducer/_cache.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/reducer/_managed_refs.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/reducer/_processors_status.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/reducer/_processors.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","d6eb-1c6c-88c3-48f6"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"d6eb-1c6c-88c3-48f6","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"c437-d221-8471-47a7","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in src/rebar/reducer","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a38de1af-672a-46e5-805d-b36d3df0be24","33dd04f8-505a-4069-9d0f-08b3bfd1c0f0","8dd89030-0b14-47b5-8b8d-1b58710e34cb","b6f7f350-1b1c-43de-8aa8-b9a02fee2871","f2a4da11-417d-4f36-821c-3c30c634bdaf","15ee2bdd-e79d-4e61-a7bb-8a5982449218"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788589178821422650,"uuid":"01707271-abd7-453b-a3ec-891656837bf2"}